{{/*
  Appending the build end date (YYYY-MM-DD) to the email subject ensures Gmail
  groups alert emails into a separate thread for each day. This allows a
  recipient engineer to mute a recurring failure thread for a day without
  ignoring it indefinitely.
*/}}
[Builder Status] {{.Build.Builder.Builder}} {{with .Build.EndTime | time}}{{.Format "2006-01-02"}}{{end}}

